    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_c_13a",
      "hash64": "AF056B5FE337AFA0",
      "text": "咦？因为我妈造出了时光机，\\n所以古代的宝可梦\\r\\n才会来到这里，对吧？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
