      "hash64": "AF08945FE33A2B22",
      "text": "在造出时光机之前的书里\\n提到了未来的宝可梦，\\r\\n这不合理吧……？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
