      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_c_16",
      "hash64": "401F8142B8B9869A",
      "text": "嗯，正是这些地方\\n让人觉得书很可疑！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_c_17a",
      "hash64": "AF12835FE34262C4",
      "text": "哪怕是胡说八道我妈也相信，\\n并且让它成为了现实，她简直太厉害了！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_c_17b",
      "hash64": "AF12865FE34267DD",
      "text": "哪怕是胡说八道我爸也相信，\\n并且让它成为了现实，他简直太厉害了！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_c_18",
      "hash64": "401F7342B8B96ED0",
      "text": "我也要向[VAR 0x1107(00FF,0101)]她他学习，\\n好好努力！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
